[strong: HER.] Gone where?

[strong: DIO.] To join the blessed in their banquets.

[strong: HER.] But what of Xenocles?

[strong: DIO.] O he be hanged!

[strong: HER.] Pythangelus?

@style verse
  [strong: XAN.] But never a word of me, Not though my shoulder's chafed so
