[strong: FR. and DIO.] Brekekekex, ko-ax, ko-ax.

[strong: DIO.] In this you'll never, never win.

[strong: FR.] This you shall not beat us in.

@style verse
  [strong: DIO.] No, nor ye prevail o'er me.
  Never! never! I'll my song
  Shout, if need be, all day long,
  Until I've learned to master your ko-ax.
  Brekekekex, ko-ax, ko-ax.
  I thought I'd put a stop to your ko-ax.

@style verse
