[strong: DIO.] Has it a copper leg?

[strong: XAN.] A copper leg, yes, one; and one of cow dung.

[strong: DIO.] O, whither shall I flee?

[strong: XAN.] O, whither I?

[strong: DIO.] My priest, protect me, and we'll sup together.

[strong: XAN.] King Heracles, we're done for.

[strong: DIO.] O, forbear, Good fellow, call me anything but that.

[strong: XAN.] Well then, Dionysus.

[strong: DIO.] O, that's worse again.

@style verse
